==Battleground==
*4 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 21.33~25.33 seconds<sup>640f~760f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zangief (Enemy)|Zangief]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 34.67~38.67 seconds<sup>1,040f~1,160f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Zangief is only at 2% magnification and the peons only 100%.

